In order to get your code to deal with the trans-thread of the buffer and response variables, you'll need to use some per-thread local variables for them, and perform a final reduction with them to update their shared counterparts. Here is what it would look like (not tested): #pragma omp parallel firstprivate( base )
{
    auto localResponse = response;
    auto localBuffer = buffer;
    #pragma omp for
