The code snippet of code you are showing triggers undefined behavior . In fact a loop-construct must adhere to some restrictions in order to be conforming (see section 2.7.1 of the OpenMP 4.0 standard). The first of these restrictions in particular reads (emphasis mine): All loops associated with the loop construct must be perfectly nested ;
