I need some help with OpenMP. Is it possible that if a thread ended in a for loop it helps then to another thread, dividing it? I have a loop in a loop where are breaks; and the threads doesn't end at the same time, so there are threads which has much work, and other threads which are done. (so there are unused cores). I run my program on a corei7, and it seems that OpenMP divide the loop to 8 threads. But the utilization starts to drop after some time when one thread did the job. #pragma omp parallel for
