answers.body:
Yes, there is a race here.  Different teams are reading and writing to the same element of the array 'y'.  Perhaps you want something like this? for(i = 0; i < n; i++) {
  #pragma omp target teams distribute parallel for
  for (j = 0; j < n; j++){
    y[j] = a*x[j] + y[j];
  }
}

